s."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The upstream is read ahead of the consumer, and elements it produces while the consumer is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"busy are buffered, so the timer measures the upstream’s gaps. A duration of zero or less"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"throws before the first element."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Example","anchor":"Example"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["for try await event in serverEvents.timeout(.seconds(30)) {","    handle(event)","}","\/\/ Throws TimeoutError.timedOut if 30 seconds pass without an event"],"syntax":"swift"},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Throws","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TimeoutError"},{"type":"text","text":" (or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"customError"},{"type":"text","text":") when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"duration"},{"type":"text","text":" passes between elements, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"any error the upstream throws."}]}]},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"On WASI, a sleep on a real clock (","type":"text"},{"code":"ContinuousClock","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"SuspendingClock","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") holds the one thread","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"until its deadline, even when other work is ready, and cancelling it doesn’t end it sooner. So the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"timer can hold the thread before the upstream runs, then count that wait against it and throw even","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"though elements were ready. A test clock is unaffected.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"references":{"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/_Concurrency/AsyncSequence/decode(type:decoder:)":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Decodes the 